# BeanPoints Loyalty & Rewards System

BrewCraft features a tier-based rewards system designed to drive customer retention.

---

## Loyalty Tiers

{% card-grid %}
{% card title="Seed Tier" icon="seedling" %}
- Entry level on sign-up
- Earn **10 BeanPoints per $1** spent
- Free birthday espresso shot
{% /card %}

{% card title="Sprout Tier" icon="leaf" %}
- Reach at 500 lifetime points
- Earn **12.5 BeanPoints per $1** spent (1.25x multiplier)
- 10% off whole bean bags
{% /card %}

{% card title="Bloom Tier" icon="flower" %}
- Reach at 1,500 lifetime points
- Earn **15 BeanPoints per $1** spent (1.5x multiplier)
- Free non-dairy milk substitutions & monthly pastry pass
{% /card %}
{% /card-grid %}

---

## Redeeming Rewards

Customers can exchange their BeanPoints for menu discounts or free drinks:

{% callout type="tip" title="Double Points Tuesdays" %}
Every Tuesday, all mobile app orders earn double BeanPoints automatically!
{% /callout %}

Test reward redemption directly in our sandbox:

{% api-operation spec="loyalty" path="/rewards/redeem" method="post" /%}
